@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Publik / Jamaah" as Jamaah
boundary "Halaman Donatur\n(/donatur)" as DonorsPage
control "Donors API\n(/api/donors)" as DonorsAPI
control "Anonymous Transactions API\n(/api/donors/anonymous/transactions)" as AnonAPI
entity "Database\n(Prisma: Donor, Transaction)" as DB

Jamaah -> DonorsPage : Buka menu Donatur (/donatur)
activate DonorsPage

DonorsPage -> DonorsAPI : GET /api/donors
activate DonorsAPI

DonorsAPI -> DB : Agregasi total kontribusi teridentifikasi & total infaq anonim
activate DB
DB --> DonorsAPI : Data ringkasan donasi & daftar donatur
deactivate DB

DonorsAPI --> DonorsPage : 200 OK (donorsList, totalIdentified, totalAnonymous)
deactivate DonorsAPI

DonorsPage -> Jamaah : Render 2 KPI Card (50:50) & Tabel Donatur Publik

alt Jamaah membuka rincian Infaq Anonim
  Jamaah -> DonorsPage : Klik kartu "Infaq Anonim"
  DonorsPage -> AnonAPI : GET /api/donors/anonymous/transactions
  activate AnonAPI

  AnonAPI -> DB : prisma.transaction.findMany({\n  where: { type: 'pemasukan', donorId: null, isVerified: true },\n  include: { report: true },\n  orderBy: { transactionDate: 'desc' }\n})
  activate DB
  DB --> AnonAPI : Daftar transaksi infaq tanpa nama
  deactivate DB

  AnonAPI --> DonorsPage : 200 OK (anonymousTransactions[])
  deactivate AnonAPI

  DonorsPage -> DonorsPage : Tampilkan Modal Dialog Ledger Infaq Anonim
  DonorsPage -> Jamaah : Lihat riwayat infaq kotak amal / hamba Allah transparan

else Jamaah melihat profil donatur individu
  Jamaah -> DonorsPage : Klik salah satu nama donatur (/donatur/[id])
  DonorsPage -> Jamaah : Navigasi ke detail profil & riwayat transaksi donatur
end

deactivate DonorsPage

@enduml
